Q7kNvwEZD4xm&_nc_oc=AdpIeIpYc5Z0qf5y4LLzAfFkqsXAJF5VtdhqpBbrB15iZ6WKXoe1gbBoerW4LsDckWg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPCTEYwKN4j_5cSQomPa3hJJj6JdRa2Gor4OopRGUbkmQ&oe=6ACB9CA2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560.png", "id": "1479527013586576", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818860_1479527016919909_4907182485101700506_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RFy-aJBJLT0Q7kNvwHqi6H2&_nc_oc=AdrZ3VvmZGfWa150faIqXPrWm7kuCao7yZkAp6fgLTq4sGZ9kLXhs19ZQUgtZ6VUQp4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNPFJKPGDpxm8JyPfOC-_OFzs90ZLPInWJLpGkBemSXdw&oe=6ACBADC2"}, "display_name": "Psychedelic Trip - Velvet", "keywords": ["meditation", "relaxation", "surreal", "psychedelic"], "long_description": "Psychedelic VR Journey takes you deep into a surreal psychedelic world, where colours breathe, shapes flow, and the rhythm of nature syncs with your mind.\nDesigned for those seeking meditation, relaxation, or a safe psychedelic-inspired trip inside virtual reality.\n{905857818952167}\n\ud83d\udd39 Features:\n\nAutomatic camera movement: immerse yourself without any controls, just let the world guide you.\n\nSurreal psychedelic landscapes filled with giant mushrooms, vibrant patterns, and dreamlike atmospheres.\n\nPerfect for meditation sessions, relaxation, or simulating a magic mushroom trip in VR.\n\nBuilt for VR headsets to maximize presence and immersion.\n\nVelvet Trip isn\u2019t a game in the traditional sense it\u2019s a guided inner journey. Put on your headset, let go, and drift into this mind-expanding world.\n", "short_description": "It's time to experience a world we've never seen and may never see a surreal realm closely resembling a psychedelic journey, a unique world with distinctive environments and lighting, brought to life through a VR headset.\n"}]}, "developer_name": "JB Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.g